# @lumis-sh/wasm-{lang}

Tree-sitter WASM grammar for {lang}

Built with [`tree-sitter build --wasm`](https://tree-sitter.github.io/tree-sitter/cli/build.html) `v{tree_sitter_cli_version}`

Used by [Lumis](https://lumis.sh) and compatible with [web-tree-sitter](https://www.npmjs.com/package/web-tree-sitter) v{tree_sitter_cli} and other WASM runtimes.

